he first five tricks, defeating your contract before you even have a chance. "],["pg",""],["ls","ws"],["ls","es"],["hc","ck"],["at","Secondly, your only hope is that West has the @CK. "],["pg",""],["md","0,c7,,ck"],["at","If East has the @CK, you are never going to get a ninth trick so the hold-up play will not help."],["pg",""],["md","0,ck,,c7"],["lc","ck"],["up","2"],["hc","sk"],["nt","\nYour analysis tells you that this is not the time for a hold-up play. The @SK isn't a sure winner unless you take it now. "],["pg",""],["lc","sk"],["hs","ss"],["at","So win the first trick "],["pg",""],["ls","ss"],["pc","sk"],["pg",""],["hs","sc"],["hs","nc"],["at","and stake everything on the Club finesse "],["pg",""],["ls","sc"],["ls","nc"],["pc","c"],["pc","c"],["pc","cq"],["pc","c"],["pg",""],["at","and you will make your contract."],["",""]]}}